      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You recall and understand vague images of forgotten temples, constructed in times of eld. These peel into a knowledge of traps and how they function, and the strange secrets they may guard. Your circumstance bonus to recall or search through old ruins, dungeons or temples applies to checks you make to Disable their hazards as well. If you find a cursed object in these locations, you know they are cursed when you successfully Identify them rather than needing to critically succeed.</span></p>"
